; Golden retriever from "input/golden_retriever.webp", drawn by hand.
; Proportions and every pose follow refs/local/dog_ref/move.pxl (6 frames per direction, 64x64).
; Retriever touches: feathered floppy ears, cream chest ruff, belly fringe, britches, plume tail.
name golden_retriever
size 64 64
scale 2
outline K A
layout
down_0 down_1 down_2 down_3 down_4 down_5
left_0 left_1 left_2 left_3 left_4 left_5
right_0 right_1 right_2 right_3 right_4 right_5
up_0 up_1 up_2 up_3 up_4 up_5
palette
K #24140c outline
A #3d2314 far-side outline (legs and tail behind the body)
B #1e1618 nose
C #8a5226 fur shade: ears, inside of legs, under the tail
D #d9707f tongue
E #b0743a fur base (gold)
F #d09c5e fur light: brows, paws
G #ecd3a2 cream: muzzle, chest ruff, feathering
H #f6eedf eye glint

